      <p class="section-desc">No complex ETL pipelines or data warehousing required.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step-grid">
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number">01</div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Provision Read-Only User</h3>
        <p class="step-text">
          Create a dedicated database user with <code>SELECT</code> privileges only. On MySQL, that is a <code>GRANT SELECT</code> user on a read replica or production instance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number">02</div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Auto-Index Schema</h3>
        <p class="step-text">
          Querywell inspects tables, columns, and foreign keys, then indexes the schema in seconds.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number">03</div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Query &amp; Export</h3>
        <p class="step-text">
          Ask business questions in plain English. Review the synthesized SQL, inspect returned rows, and export results directly to CSV.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

